      "sourceTextSha256": "4636f0c6be1b4ee4ce9658660ee639336f149e375f4132439b35b33bb90c7e0d",
      "text": "6 February · Half-day tour (4 h) to Corcovado with an English-speaking guide: an open eco-train climbs through the Tijuca Forest to the 38-metre statue of Christ the Redeemer, at 710 m, completed in 1931, with a breathtaking panorama of the Rio–Niterói Bridge, Guanabara Bay, the Botanical Garden, the Maracanã Stadium and Sugar Loaf. In the evening, watch the sunset from the Arpoador rocks.",
