      "sourceTextSha256": "3f3e5c2ea13a22c819b91b4a90ac9c71414fe7de40083a90b739ed7b953eae50",
      "text": "7 February · A free day to rest before the Carnival. In the evening, transfer to the Sambadrome, where Brazil’s most famous samba schools compete all night for the title, judged on their performance, extraordinary costumes and floats. After the parade, transfer back to the hotel.",
